    "text": "CONCLUDED\n3 days ago\nBig Tech Puts Stock Market Win Streak in Peril\nThe S&P 500 and Nasdaq could close lower for the first time in more than two weeks, and big tech stocks were a big reason why.\nThe S&P was down 0.6%, while the Nasdaq was down 0.9%. The Dow was down 416 points, or 0.8%. All three have closed at a record in five-straight sessions.\nThe S&P and Nasdaq finished Tuesday riding nine-session winning streaks. But some of their most important stocks were falling sharply on Wednesday.",
